#: times.cpp:26
msgid ""
"The Ancient Egyptians believed it was 360 days long, resulting in there being "
"360 degrees in a circle.  For the sake of Konv, a day is considered 365.25637 "
"days. (A sidereal year)"
msgstr ""
"Os antigos exípcios crian que tiña 360 dias, de aí os 360 graus da "
"circunferéncia. Para Konv, un ano ten 365,25637 dias (ano sidéreo)"

